      "quote": "Make Blackjack – In this card game, making a Blackjack means finishing precisely on 21. If you can pull this off with only your first two cards, you’ll earn a 3:2 payout.\nAs Bovada Casino’s primary version of Blackjack, this card game is played using a total of six decks.\nThe decks are shuffled after every hand, just like at a live casino.\nYou can also boost your winnings by doubling down and splitting whenever the opportunity should present itself.\nWith a huge max bet of $2,500 and the ability to play up to three hands at once, you can win a huge payday playing Blackjack.\nJust as the name suggests, Single Deck Blackjack takes things back to the basics by playing with just a single deck of cards that gets shuffled after every hand.\nFeaturing two decks in the shoe, this version of the famous casino game provides yet another option for online Blackjack players at Bovada Casino.\nThis game includes all of the same rules as Single Deck Blackjack, but has twice as many aces and face cards in the deck.\nJust remember this game only allows you to split once per round and features a maximum bet of $250 per hand.\nClassic Single Deck Blackjack allows Bovada players to combine the excitement of Single Deck Blackjack with the realistic gameplay of Classic Blackjack. The rules and betting limits are the same as Single Deck Blackjack so there are no surprises, but you can enjoy the feeling of sitting at a virtual table and handling your virtual chips.\nThe European version of this famous table game functions similarly to the standard version of the game, however there is one key difference – in the European version, the dealer doesn’t receive a second card until after the player has made their decision, including doubling and splitting.\nWith every other aspect of the game unchanged, European Blackjack can be a good choice for players looking to switch things up on the felt.\nThis innovative game allows you to play Blackjack online against real dealers that are streaming live from a studio, letting you interact with a real live casino."
