      "url": "https://hub.bovada.lv/casino/table-games/live-dealer-super-6-guide/",
      "quote": "Super 6 is a fun and exciting table game featuring plenty of betting options. The game is very similar to baccarat, but there are a few key differences that make it all its own.\nThe game is played with a six-deck shoe and the Live Casino feature allows you to see the actual cards being dealt right before your eyes.\nPlayer bets pay out even money, as do Banker bets (minus a five percent commission), while a Tie bet pays out 8:1. The primary difference with Super 6 is this – if the Banker wins with a total of 6, the payout is 1:2 (or in other words, you’ll win half of what you bet).\nAnother popular side bet in Live Casino Super 6 is the Pairs wager. This bet wins if the first two cards dealt to the Player or the Banker combine to make a pair. For example, if the first two cards dealt are 10-10 or K-K, the side bet is deemed a winner. This side bet also has a generous payout at 11:1. There’s also the Either Pair side bet option, which works the same way but applies to both the Banker and Dealer’s hand, and comes with 5:1 payout odds."
